Spec: Portable Android Agent state authority

Purpose:
  Preserve actual-caller declarations, owner decisions and scoped connection journals outside application SDKs.

Structure:
  ./src: Transactional state authority and its platform database ports.

Must:
  Keep owner approval separate from application requests and make retained operations caller scoped.
  Preserve active approved authority when a newer pending declaration is denied.
  Bind local access to the actual caller generation, approved import, trusted peer and exact remote service.
